msgid ""
"Lists come from indexes: Platform Explorer and Radar’s own crawler. Radar "
"reads the rows from the index and then checks each row’s facts with proofs "
"where it can; the checked value wins over the index’s. Without an index, you"
" can still open anything whose ID you know. Decentralized only mode switches"
" the indexes off to show exactly that: only what DAPI nodes and the Platform"
" SDK can answer."
msgstr ""

